<< /A 40 0 R /Alt (Flowchart illustrating a systematic review process: out of 19,582 database records, 5,908 duplicates were removed, 13,625 excluded by title and abstract, 49 reports assessed, 8 excluded, resulting in 41 studies included in the final review.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 28 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 41 0 R /Alt (Forest plot displaying results from thirty-eight studies on a specified outcome, listing event counts, totals, weights, and confidence intervals. Each study is represented by a red square indicating effect size, with horizontal lines showing ninety-five percent confidence intervals. Summary diamonds near the bottom represent overall pooled effect estimates for both fixed and random effects models, with heterogeneity statistics listed below the plot. The x-axis ranges from zero to approximately 0.8.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 30 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /A 42 0 R /Alt (Scatter plot titled Freeman-Tukey Double Arcsine Transformed Proportion with standard error on the y-axis and transformed proportion on the x-axis, displaying funnel-shaped dashed guidelines and points indicating individual study results.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 32 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
