<< /A 43 0 R /Alt (Forest plot comparing odds ratios and confidence intervals for multiple studies in training and validation sets, with pooled results shown as diamonds. Studies show odds ratios below one, with heterogeneity statistics and weight distribution for each set.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 33 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
